OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FOne of Britain's biggest trade unions
OL,7,Fhas threatened to ballot London bus
OL,8,Fdrivers for strike action, warning the
OL,9,Fcapital could be brought to a
OL,10,Fstandstill unless urgent action is
OL,11,Ftaken to improve working conditions.
OL,13,FSpeaking exclusively to ITV News
OL,14,FLondon, Unite's general secretary
OL,15,FSharon Graham said drivers were at
OL,16,F'crisis point' over issues including
OL,17,Fextreme heat, fatigue, a lack of
OL,18,Ftoilet facilities and assaults.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FShe said the union was considering
OL,7,Fbringing together bus operators,
OL,8,FTransport for London, the Government
OL,9,Fand the union at an emergency summit.
OL,11,FSharon Graham told ITV News London:
OL,12,F"The only way that we can get people
OL,13,Fto listen is by the bus workers now
OL,14,Fsaying, quite frankly, we've had
OL,15,Fenough. This is the end of the line.
OL,17,F"We are bringing together all of our
OL,18,Fbus reps in London.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,F"We are having the conversation with
OL,7,Fthem, of course, we're trying to move
OL,8,Fthe operators, but should there be no
OL,9,Fmovement, then of course we have the
OL,10,Fonly option we have is to say we are
OL,11,Fgoing to have to withdraw labour
OL,12,Fbecause they're not listening."
OL,14,FITV News London has repeatedly exposed
OL,15,Fthe shocking working conditions of bus
OL,16,Fdrivers and Sharon Graham pledged to
OL,17,Fpersonally lead Unite's campaign on
OL,18,Fthe issue and raise it with Prime
OL,19,FMinister Andy Burnham.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,F"I will be speaking to Andy Burnham
OL,7,Fdirectly about this, what is really
OL,8,Fclear is the situation in buses has to
OL,9,Fchange now.
OL,11,F"I'm personally now going to be
OL,12,Fleading this from the union and I'm
OL,13,Fgoing to be personally speaking to
OL,14,FAndy Burnham to say, look, this has
OL,15,Fgone beyond anything that is
OL,16,Facceptable for workers to come to work
OL,17,Fin - this is now at crisis point."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FMs Graham said the current approach of
OL,7,Fdealing with individual issues through
OL,8,Fseparate operators was no longer
OL,9,Fworking.
OL,11,FShe accused TfL and bus companies of
OL,12,Fpassing responsibility between each
OL,13,Fother.
OL,15,F"You meet TfL, they say, go to the
OL,16,Foperators. You meet the operators,
OL,17,Fthey say, well, look, we're going to
OL,18,Fhave a conversation with TfL," she
OL,19,Fsaid.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FShe wants all major stakeholders
OL,7,Faround the same table.
OL,9,F"We need an emergency summit," she
OL,10,Fadded - and urged the government to
OL,11,Falso get involved.
OL,13,FGraham criticised a newly established
OL,14,Fheat task force, saying it had not
OL,15,Fgone far enough.
OL,17,FShe said issues such as heat, fatigue,
OL,18,Ftoilet facilities and assaults were
OL,19,Fbeing dealt with separately when they
OL,20,Fshould be considered together.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,F"It's gone way beyond task forces,"
OL,7,Fshe said.
OL,9,F"We need a summit."
OL,11,FThe Unite boss said some London bus
OL,12,Fdrivers avoided drinking water because
OL,13,Fthey were worried about being unable
OL,14,Fto find a toilet during their shifts.
OL,16,FShe said some workers were resorting
OL,17,Fto using bottles when they needed to
OL,18,Fgo and described the situation as
OL,19,F"completely degrading".
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FShe also criticised working
OL,7,Ftemperatures inside bus cabs, "It's
OL,8,Fimpossible for people to work in that
OL,9,Fheat," she said.
OL,11,FSharon Graham said drivers should have
OL,12,Fproper air conditioning rather than
OL,13,Fair-cooling systems which she claimed
OL,14,Fsimply circulate warm air.
OL,16,FShe also called for changes to shift
OL,17,Fpatterns, saying drivers could be left
OL,18,Ffeeling "jet lagged" because of
OL,19,Finsufficient rest.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FGraham rejected any suggestion the
OL,7,Funion had not done enough to protect
OL,8,Fits own members, or had got too close
OL,9,Fto Transport for London.
OL,11,FShe said she had criticised Labour
OL,12,Fgovernments and TfL when she believed
OL,13,Fworkers were not being treated
OL,14,Fproperly.
OL,16,F"I don't care the colour of the
OL,17,Frosette of anybody in any position,"
OL,18,Fshe said.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,F"If you are not standing by workers,
OL,7,Fthen I'm going to make that and say
OL,8,Fthat very, very loudly."
OL,10,FShe warned that if TfL and operators
OL,11,Fdid not move quickly, Unite would have
OL,12,F"no other course of action" but to
OL,13,Fballot bus workers across London.
OL,15,F"We don't want to do that," she said.
OL,17,F"The workers certainly don't want to
OL,18,Fdo that, but they cannot continue to
OL,19,Fwork under this strain and in this
OL,20,Fenvironment."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G10/11
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,374,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F373A1786537135
OL,3,CUnite threatens London-wide bus strike
OL,4,Cover driver 'crisis conditions'
OL,6,FHer warning raises the prospect of a
OL,7,Fmajor disruption to London's bus
OL,8,Fnetwork if Unite proceeds with a
OL,9,FLondon-wide ballot and members
OL,10,Fsubsequently vote for strike action.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                G11/11
